# Cross-platform contract for this repository. The Mac and the Windows box must
# produce byte-identical working trees from the same commit.
#
# LF in the repository AND in the working tree. Git for Windows would otherwise
# convert to CRLF on checkout, silently giving the two machines different bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows-only scripts. .bat/.cmd genuinely require CRLF; .ps1 is kept CRLF so
# Notepad-class tools stay usable on the Windows box.
*.ps1   text eol=crlf
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf

# POSIX scripts must stay LF regardless of platform.
*.sh    text eol=lf

# --- text: diff hints ---------------------------------------------------------
